 "name_en": "Safety Data Sheets in the Value Chain (3VQ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Safety Data Sheets in the Value Chain (3VQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item covers the main process steps for the maintenance of safety data sheets for products during sales processes.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Products flagged as relevant for compliance must have a completed safety data sheet assessment by the product steward. A missing assessment results in an automatic country/region-specific block of sales order fulfillment that can be resolved by the product steward, typically by assigning a relevant safety data sheet to the products.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Flag products as relevant for compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine and assign markets to your products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Derive relevant compliance purposes from the assigned markets for your products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use dedicated compliance requirements to manage, version, and store safety data sheets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assess product requirements for safety data sheets in specific countries and language variants and maintain the status and documents</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Mitigate compliance risks with up-to-date information integrated into the value chain</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Inform product steward specialists about new markets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the safety data sheet requirements and management into the general product compliance management processes, providing an integrated view on the status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the safety data sheet processes of a product in business processes within the value chain</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the product stewardship department via a release cycle into sales and distribution processes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>价值链中的安全技术说明书 (3VQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖主要流程步骤，用于在销售流程期间维护产品的安全技术说明书。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">标记为与合规性相关的产品必须具有产品管理已完成的安全技术说明书评估。缺少评估会导致销售订单履行的自动国家/地区特定冻结，可以由产品管理部门解决，通常通过为产品分配相关的安全技术说明书。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品标记为与合规性相关</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定市场并将其分配到产品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从为产品分配的市场派生相关合规性目的。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用专用合规性要求管理、版本化和存储安全技术说明书</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估特定国家/地区和语言变式中安全技术说明书的产品要求，并维护状态和文档</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1eac025f243649eca00209496c7c59c2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过将最新信息集成到价值链中，降低合规性风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通知产品管理专家有关新市场的信息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将安全技术说明书要求和管理集成到常规产品合规性管理流程，提供有关状态的集成视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在价值链的业务流程中，集成产品的安全技术说明书流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过发布周期将产品管理部门集成到销售和分销流程中。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
